sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Txn as Transaction / Executor
    participant WAL as WalManager
    participant Buffer as WAL In-Memory Append Buffer
    participant Disk as Physical Disk (jarvix.wal)

    Txn->>WAL: append_record(LogRecord::Insert { txn_id, rid, data })
    Note over WAL: next_lsn.fetch_add(rec_len) -> Monotonic LSN assigned
    WAL->>WAL: Serialize record bytes (CRC32, LSN, prev_lsn, type, data)
    WAL->>Buffer: write_all(&record_bytes)
    Note over WAL: In-memory write completed (Sub-microsecond latency)
    WAL-->>Txn: Ok(assigned_lsn)

    Note over Txn: Subsequent operations continue...

    Txn->>WAL: flush(commit_lsn) [Enforced during COMMIT]
    WAL->>Disk: file.write_all(&buffered_bytes)
    WAL->>Disk: file.sync_data() (fsync syscall)
    Note over Disk: Bits physically committed to non-volatile platter/SSD
    WAL-->>Txn: Ok(()) [DURABILITY GUARANTEED]
